    "notes": "Inspected all 12 views. Genuinely hollow with a modelled interior wall, clearly visible in the top view, and a properly finished foot in the bottom view. The blue floral pattern wraps continuously with no visible UV seam across the eight orbit views, and the rim and foot banding stay concentric. 9.4k tris.",
    "limitations": [
      "Interior is dark and untextured below the rim, so top-down cameras will see a black cavity.",
      "Pattern is a generic blue-and-white transfer with no maker's mark."
    ],
